E51A:
  procedure options(main);
  /* [E2E-51/P1] PRIMARY: FIXED BINARY variable-divisor DIVISION, z
     = a / b.  The EXISTING DR object golden/f6probe/F005/F005.REL
     (plain-fixed bank, one statement) lowers it LHLD a / PUSH H /
     LHLD b / POP D / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD z, CODE 0017.  Mine
     refuses codegen: DIV by non-constant [TBD] (the HAMM-00 rev1
     blocker).  This row repeats the settled shape inside the E51
     bank to tie the new objects to the old witness: predicted
     CODE-SEGMENT bytes EQUAL to F005 modulo the extra variable
     reloc and the module-name record; refusal by DR would falsify
     the F005 reading. */
  dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  z = a / b;
end E51A;
